 can be 27 m long."},{"icon":"🦑","type":"sea-monsters","x":265.3,"y":423.5,"cell":3231,"i":24,"name":"Bingford Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 29 m long."},{"icon":"👹","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":1366.88,"y":806.18,"cell":6339,"i":25,"name":"Fovallum Undead","note":"Locals speak of a hungry Undead who inhabits Fovallum hills and snatches people from homes."},{"icon":"🌳","type":"sacred-forests","x":269,"y":492.7,"cell":3692,"i":26,"name":"Oyuzun Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Turchian Deities."},{"icon":"🌳","type":"sacred-forests","x":1486.41,"y":250.78,"cell":1686,"i":27,"name":"Treter Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Angshire Ancestors."},{"icon":"🌲","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":782.41,"y":83.31,"cell":277,"i":28,"name":"Koten Pinery","note":"A pinery sacred to local Slovan Spirits."},{"icon":"🌴","type":"sacred-palm-groves","px":13,"x":656.44,"y":698.09,"cell":5292,"i":29,"name":"Cadaia Palm Grove","note":"A palm grove sacred to local Circle of the Lavender Enlightened Being."},{"icon":"💰","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1317.37,"y":704.27,"cell":5347,"i":30,"name":"Elidunum Hyenas","note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"💰","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1294.03,"y":750.94,"cell":5846,"i":31,"name":"Niledionium Rats","note":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"icon":"💰","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1464.2,"y":347,"cell":2618,"i":32,"name":"Satonorton Beavers","note":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"icon":"💰","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":861.77,"y":444.78,"cell":3483,"i":33,"name":"Dorngen Rooks","note":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":385.45,"y":97.85,"cell":328,"i":34,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":625,"y":56,"cell":94,"i":35,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1299.9,"y":422.7,"cell":3327,"i":36,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1392.26,"y":659.71,"cell":4982,"i":37,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🗿","type":"statues","x":1173.15,"y":661.58,"cell":4968,"i":38,"name":"Kanos Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༇༲༉༤༱༨༘༿༇༯༅༴༌༔༿༓༩༻༿༠༱༶༲༣༰༐༄༦༾༼༴༪༧༥༖༦༺༄༷༥༧༐༧༌༦༰༁༛༴༠༼ༀ༐༷༬༬༳༦༺༪༠༒༆༹༧༩༶༲༮༅༢༭༰༤་༤༣༷༚༤༫</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"statues","x":307.33,"y":810.64,"cell":6372,"i":39,"name":"Mopsos Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳪ⳃⳞⲼⳊⳒⳌⳭ⳾ⳂⳂⲾⳢⲲ⳩ⳎⳒⳁⳁ ⳌⳢⲶⳔⳈⳒⳤ⳾ⳊⳁⲶⳬⳤⳬⳢⳢⳃⳌ⳧ⳂⳀⳐⳄⳔⲴⳌⳆⲼ ⳬⳄⳒⳌⲴⳚⳂⲾⳆ⳾ⳭⲴ⳩Ⳝ ⳥Ⳑ⳥Ⲻ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"statues","x":406.27,"y":380.66,"cell":2882,"i":40,"name":"Pelug Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳘⲼⳲⳔⳚⳆⳚⳤⳠⳞⳫⳜⲺⳈⲾ ⳁⳈⳒⳄⳘⳎⳂⳫⳂⳜⲴⳄⳤⳭⳘⳂⳌⳲⳊⳊⳁⳠⳚⲾⳎ⳥ⳎⳜⳚ⳹ⳎⳭⳢⳎⳲⲴ ⲼⳎ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"statues","x":299.43,"y":494.82,"cell":3776,"i":41,"name":"Korlerten Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳒⳊⳃⲺⳊⲼⳞⲲⳎ ⳪Ⳟ⳧ⳜⳚⳜⳂⳖⳞⳜ ⳧Ⳗ ⲲⳌ⳩⳪ⳭⲶⲺⳂⳚⳆ⳥ⳊⳢⳁⳭ  ⲴⲸⳖ⳧ⲾⳂⲾ</div>"},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":1145.46,"y":99.18,"cell":390,"i":42,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":1223.62,"y":711.23,"cell":5464,"i":43,"name":"Ruined Stronghold","note":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":472.12,"y":243.88,"cell":1604,"i":44,"name":"Ruined Fortress","note":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":586.23,"y":384.78,"cell":2896,"i":45,"name":"Ruined Outpost","note":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":149.46,"y":257.03,"cell":1694,"i":46,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"📚","type":"libraries","x":766.32,"y":513.28,"cell":3928,"i":47,"name":"Kocaraok Library","note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"🎪","type":"circuses","x":791.71,"y":437.7,"cell":3385,"i":48,"name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"🎪","type":"circuses","x":917.97,"y":318.59,"cell":2343,"i":49,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"🎪","type":"circuses","x":780.83,"y":422.18,"cell":3281,"i":50,"name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"🤺","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":1454.08,"y":576.38,"cell":4489,"i":51,"name":"Contucenil Tournament","note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of acumen in Contucenil, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"🎠","type":"fairs","x":198.18,"y":308.12,"cell":2170,"i":52,"name":"Soche Fair","note":"A fair is being held in Soche, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"icon":"🐗","type":"migration","x":638.35,"y":275.24,"cell":1849,"i":53,"name":"Antelopes migration","note":"A huge group of antelopes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"💃🏽","type":"dances","x":534.3,"y":621.42,"cell":4614,"i":54,"name":"Ponha exhibition","note":"A exhibition has been organised at Ponha as a chance to gather the spiritual leaders of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"icon":"💦","type":"mirage","x":624.85,"y":690.86,"cell":5166,"i":55,"name":"Peculiar mirage","note":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"icon":"🦇","type":"caves","x":688.73,"y":793.74,"cell":6163,"i":56,"name":"Sintral Cavern","note":"The Sintral Cavern. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"icon":"🪦","type":"necropolises","x":982.37,"y":232.26,"cell":1529,"i":57,"name":"Porvisa Necropolis","note":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":671.3,"y":807.32,"cell":6284,"i":58,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/6284\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":811.41,"y":95.1,"cell":364,"i":59,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/364\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":473.4,"y":219.69,"cell":1373,"i":60,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1373\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":725.24,"y":894.44,"cell":7027,"i":61,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/7027\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":1414.21,"y":